From: Uke recovery maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] gui: resolve recovery support headers from the parent directory

The Soong GUI target does not search the recovery root for quoted headers.
Use explicit parent paths, as the existing GUI recovery integrations do.
Host fragment tests alone did not exercise this Android include boundary.

--- a/gui/battery.cpp
+++ b/gui/battery.cpp
@@ -49 +49 @@
-#include "ure-telemetry.hpp"
+#include "../ure-telemetry.hpp"
--- a/gui/action.cpp
+++ b/gui/action.cpp
@@ -82 +82 @@
-#include "ure-theme.hpp"
+#include "../ure-theme.hpp"
--- a/gui/pages.cpp
+++ b/gui/pages.cpp
@@ -63 +63 @@
-#include "ure-theme.hpp"
+#include "../ure-theme.hpp"
